{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful exorcism, the priests trapped your demonic soul inside a stick and cast you back into Hell. You awaken at the very bottom determined to climb your way back to Dad's throne to ask him to turn you back into a demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108540/extras/8b6c0794c5f00cf047c1612377fb87cf.poster.avif?t=1772608843\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108540/extras/8b6c0794c5f00cf047c1612377fb87cf.webm?t=1772608843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108540/extras/8b6c0794c5f00cf047c1612377fb87cf.mp4?t=1772608843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a rage game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a stick, you\u2019ll navigate through the twisted layers of Hell, each inspired by the haunting and surreal visions of Hieronymus Bosch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>simple controls</strong> to master <strong>precise movement</strong>, solve <strong>punishing physics challenges</strong>, and endure <strong>endless falls</strong> as you fight your way upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake will send you tumbling back down. Every success will feel like a miracle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108540/extras/62db203c50ed9670a0ac9c9bd09cb2e6.poster.avif?t=1772608843\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108540/extras/62db203c50ed9670a0ac9c9bd09cb2e6.webm?t=1772608843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108540/extras/62db203c50ed9670a0ac9c9bd09cb2e6.mp4?t=1772608843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments inspired by the paintings of Hieronymus Bosch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mechanics, unforgiving difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll truly feel like you\u2019re in Hell while playing this game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I am on the highway to hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108540/a1a5735fdc1ea2786b134ac33b16029db8767139.jpg"},{"name":"Get the hell out of here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108540/ad243b1545e07538c0d31bb6d106ab07912f8842.jpg"},{"name":"Beat the game in one hour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108540/ee91e6f0053afba0243076a0b40aab7a62fc71ec.jpg"},{"name":"Beat the game in 30 minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108540/6159f63213944a65d80c9f81ca5d2e316df44e59.jpg"},{"name":"Beat the game in 10 minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108540/8521f0893952a5f3908af9070eb2615946b4d2d5.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108540?t=1772608843","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108540/4cf2b2e6ad7a03e1c407e1fa6f838da1494320dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772608843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108540/7c047ad1710e3ca01a387bda97687bda3ae72c18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772608843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/410854